WEBVTT

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.293
Down, then.

00:01:26.493 --> 00:01:30.860
The first metres are bright and busy. A shoal of fish turns as one.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.991
But water swallows light quickly. Red goes first, then yellow, then green.

00:01:36.191 --> 00:01:39.529
At two hundred metres, only a dim blue is left.

00:01:39.729 --> 00:01:42.091
This is where the twilight zone begins.

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:43.884
Two things go deeper.

